(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-14","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["[[daylight|日光]]落上税牌时，沈砚发现红字还没干。看守说不要[[offend|冒犯]]掌柜，今日正是清债的[[critical|关键]]一天。新水契在此竟成了[[controversial|有争议的]]坏事；摊贩投来[[hostile|不友善的]]目光，却仍照常[[require|要求]]别村交运费。只有门边的[[grocer|杂货商]]不敢接山村的铜钱。他偷偷指向[[canal|运河]]，说税牌是今早乘船来的。背面粘着新[[gum|树胶]]，遮了旧日期。沈砚没揭胶，先请罗清描下露出的半个数字，免得一伸手就被说成毁证。","杂货商不愿看熟客[[starve|挨饿]]，却怕与大商行[[compete|竞争]]，连借米的[[means|办法]]也没有。摊后一个教外乡孩子认字的[[tutor|先生]]替他作证，听见锁柜的[[click|咔嗒声]]后，拿出昨晚的[[quotation|报价单]]：盐价未变。报价的[[source|来源]]是许庭自己的柜台。窗外水市的[[scenery|景色]]热闹，罗清想起医馆里的[[disease|病患]]，催沈砚先问售货条件。杂货商[[finally|终于]]递来一张约见纸，许庭下午在河院有[[appointment|约见]]，肯谈旧债，不肯谈木闸。","约见纸标着[[confidential|保密]]，但走进那座[[multicultural|多种文化交汇的]]商埠，他们没有装成富客。饭摊里，沈砚不敢[[consume|吃光]]最后半碗粥，将剩下的留给跑腿孩子。孩子带他们穿过[[avenue|林荫路]]，绕开商行[[stable|马厩]]，河院门口正停着运送伤者的[[ambulance|救护车]]，其实是挂白布的平板马车。一位车夫说取水闸最近扎伤人，仍坚信账房会付费用。沈砚没有嘲笑这份[[conviction|确信]]，只问他怎样留下收款凭条，发现所有伤者都被要求在空纸上按指印。","许庭说还债的[[process|程序]]不能破例，语气却像谈[[intimate|亲密的]]旧交。他称山上改契的[[result|结果]]是失去担保，因此必须先[[consult|查阅]]税署的旧账。院墙外，一座小[[dam|水坝]]把船逼近他家的卸货口，马夫扣紧[[harness|挽具]]等待装米。沈砚问为何未通知村民担保变更，许庭说规矩[[rigid|严格]]，不能为了某人的[[ideal|理想]]而改。罗清拿出约见纸，请他用书面说明究竟哪一项旧条款能[[bind|约束]]未借过钱的村户。许庭这才收起笑，叫账房去取红匣。","账房提起十二年前的[[tragedy|惨案]]，说撤去山门优先权很[[selfish|自私]]。罗清不接这句评判，要求旧债的[[evaluation|估价]]。院里孩子用[[bucket|水桶]]洗血迹，老车夫递上此前的债款[[declaration|申报单]]，袖上仍是[[bloody|血染的]]印子。沈砚的第一项[[finding|发现]]是两张债单印章相同，借户却不同。他请求送河院的巡税[[court|法庭]]对看。许庭拒绝，称这是[[domestic|内部的]]事务；随后指向贴在门边的[[editorial|评论文章]]，上面把山村写成赖账的恶客。","罗清没有拿病人去换信用。她愿[[venture|冒险]]押上自己的旅费请杂货商留存旧牌，而不押药箱。门柱石料有[[volcano|火山]]熔岩般的气孔，胶滴陷在其中；沈砚若[[polish|磨光]]石面就会失去滴胶的新旧边界，便只拓了图。许庭吩咐伙计[[chop|劈]]掉装坏轴的木箱，说别把破车带进院。沈砚站在箱前，告诉他锯口与库房门边的细锯宽度相同。许庭忽然允许他们今晚宿在马厩，条件是不出市门。不是款待，是他还没想好怎样处理这根轴。"],"en":["In [[daylight|daylight]], Shen saw that the red tax notice was still wet. The guard warned him not to [[offend|offend]] Xu on a [[critical|critical]] debt-clearing day. The new water agreement was [[controversial|controversial]] here. Traders looked [[hostile|hostile]], but continued to [[require|require]] normal fees from other villages. A frightened [[grocer|grocer]] pointed at the [[canal|canal]]: the notice had arrived by boat this morning. Fresh [[gum|gum]] covered its old date. Luo traced the half-visible number before anyone could accuse Shen of damaging evidence.","The grocer hated seeing customers [[starve|starve]] but dared not [[compete|compete]] with the house and had no [[means|means]] to lend rice. A [[tutor|tutor]] behind his stall heard the cabinet’s [[click|click]] and produced yesterday’s [[quotation|quotation]]: salt prices were unchanged. Its [[source|source]] was Xu’s own counter. The lively river [[scenery|scenery]] reminded Luo of patients suffering from [[disease|disease]]. The grocer [[finally|finally]] supplied a notice of an [[appointment|appointment]] at Xu’s riverside courtyard that afternoon. Xu would discuss debt, not gates.","The notice said [[confidential|confidential]]. In the [[multicultural|multicultural]] port, they made no pretence of wealth. Shen did not [[consume|consume]] his entire bowl, leaving some for a messenger child. The child led them down an [[avenue|avenue]] past the [[stable|stable]]. An [[ambulance|ambulance]], a flat wagon with white cloth, waited outside. Its driver said a gate had injured workers and expressed his [[conviction|conviction]] that the office would pay. Shen asked about receipts and learned that injured workers were being made to thumbprint blank paper.","Xu defended the payment [[process|process]] in the voice of an [[intimate|intimate]] friend. He called lost security a [[result|result]] of the mountain’s changes and proposed to [[consult|consult]] old tax accounts. A small [[dam|dam]] forced boats towards his landing; a carter tightened a [[harness|harness]]. Xu said [[rigid|rigid]] rules could not bend to Shen’s [[ideal|ideal]]. Luo requested the written clause that could [[bind|bind]] households which had never borrowed. Xu stopped smiling and called for a red box.","The clerk invoked the old [[tragedy|tragedy]] and called ending sect priority [[selfish|selfish]]. Luo requested an [[evaluation|evaluation]] of the debt instead. A child washed stains with a [[bucket|bucket]]. The driver produced a debt [[declaration|declaration]], his sleeve still [[bloody|bloody]]. Shen’s first [[finding|finding]] was identical seals with different borrowers. He asked for comparison before the tax [[court|court]]. Xu called it a [[domestic|domestic]] matter and pointed to an [[editorial|editorial]] portraying the villagers as debt cheats.","Luo would [[venture|venture]] her travel money to have the grocer preserve the old notice, but not her medicine chest. Glue lay in the porous pillar stone, which resembled rock from a [[volcano|volcano]]. To [[polish|polish]] it would destroy the boundary between old and new drops, so Shen traced them. Xu ordered a worker to [[chop|chop]] the box holding the damaged axle. Shen blocked him and said its cut matched the fine saw beside the storeroom. Xu suddenly offered stable beds if they stayed inside the market. He had not yet decided what to do about the axle."]});
